### City state and calculated baseline
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/context

### A. Manual scenario from the case
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{"decisions":[{"measure_id":"M7","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M8","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M10","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M12","district":null},{"measure_id":"M5","district":"Сарыарка"}]}

### B. Invalid: budget 109, no Score
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{"decisions":[{"measure_id":"M7","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M8","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M10","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M13","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M5","district":"Сарыарка"}]}

### C. Exact search within budget 90, no key required
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"objective":"max_score","budget_limit":90,"top_k":3}

### C. Natural-language advisor, requires LLM configuration
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Найди лучший сценарий до бюджета 90"}

### D. Improve Nura, no key required
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"objective":"focus_district","focus_district":"Нура","budget_limit":100,"top_k":3}

### D. Natural-language advisor
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Улучши Нуру"}

### E. Compare placement of the health centre; deltas mean B - A
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{"scenario_a":[{"measure_id":"M7","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M8","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M10","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M12"},{"measure_id":"M5","district":"Сарыарка"}],"scenario_b":[{"measure_id":"M7","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M8","district":"Есиль"},{"measure_id":"M10","district":"Нура"},{"measure_id":"M12"},{"measure_id":"M5","district":"Сарыарка"}]}
